            <SuggestionsModal isOpen={isSuggestionsModalOpen} result={suggestionsResult} onClose={() => setIsSuggestionsModalOpen(false)} error={suggestionsError} isLoading={isGeneratingSuggestions} onSuggestionClick={handleSuggestionClick} />
